  "totalBlocks": 23,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58f40d2a51b4963b",
      "translationZh": "使用您现有的 Azure 协议：Claude 有资格参加 Microsoft Azure Consumption Commitment (MACC)，并且可与当前的 Azure 协议和账单配合使用，从而免除单独的供应商审批。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22130997084e25ba",
      "translationZh": "使用您偏好的语言进行开发：通过 Python、TypeScript 和 C# SDKs 使用 Claude，并配合 Microsoft Entra 进行身份验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f13a600fc52f32",
      "translationZh": "Claude 今日开始在 Global Standard 部署中推出，使用我们的标准 API 定价，US DataZone 将很快推出。请访问我们的定价页面了解详情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c2f23a895f8f8897",
      "translationZh": "为您的使用场景选择合适的模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d412f8e460504a5",
      "translationZh": "Microsoft 客户可直接在 Foundry 中访问 Claude 的前沿模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81cb785d11366e8d",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 4.5 是全球最佳的编码模型，也是构建复杂代理的最强模型。当您需要在复杂推理、多步骤代理工作流以及自主编码任务上获得最先进的性能时，请使用 Sonnet 4.5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a32d34d6d7eec3",
      "translationZh": "Haiku 4.5 是我们最快的模型，其性能接近前沿，但成本仅为 Sonnet 的三分之一。请在需要速度和成本效益的高吞吐量场景中部署 Haiku 4.5，例如子代理、客户支持自动化、内容审核或实时编码辅助。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa693d845abfc19b",
      "translationZh": "Opus 4.1 是专门推理任务的卓越模型。当需要持续专注和严谨细致的复杂多步骤问题时，请使用 Opus 4.1。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "584f4a51a27a98de",
      "translationZh": "所有模型在 Foundry 中支持多种 Claude 开发者平台功能，包括代码执行工具、网络搜索和获取、引用、视觉、工具使用、提示缓存等。浏览我们的文档以了解更多受支持的功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "942b14d3488107f5",
      "translationZh": "Claude 现已通过 Microsoft Foundry 提供公开预览版。访问 Microsoft Foundry 目录以部署 Claude Sonnet 4.5、Claude Haiku 4.5 或 Claude Opus 4.1，或浏览我们的文档以了解更多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f9dba38b243ff21",
      "translationZh": "与客户共同开发企业前沿防护措施",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab0b3c438a481733",
      "translationZh": "改进我们的对齐和安全工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a81a773d6c9c8b6",
      "translationZh": "7 月 30 日，我们报告了三起 Claude 模型未经授权访问真实计算机系统的事件。我们正在对这两起事件进行深入分析，并计划与 METR 合作进行独立审查。与此同时，我们将分享过去一个月所做的一些更改。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db493008cb1b8f03",
      "translationZh": "预览 Model Hardware Standard",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f8f8f0257b53b65",
      "translationZh": "我们正在向首批科学研究实验室和先进制造商开放 Model Hardware Standard（MHS）的研究预览版，这是一个共享规范，用于让 AI 代理安全地操作物理设备。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
